#!/bin/sh
# systemd-sleep hook: after resume, ask the daemon to re-apply profile, fans and
# keyboard lighting (the firmware may reset them). The daemon is not restarted,
# so the kbd_backlight LED seen by UPower stays in place.
[ "$1" = post ] || exit 0
/usr/bin/python3 - <<'PY' || true
import socket
s = socket.socket(socket.AF_UNIX)
s.settimeout(5)
s.connect("/run/linux-sense.sock")
s.sendall(b'{"cmd": "restore"}\n')
s.recv(65536)
PY
exit 0
